        "matched_product": "wool blanket",
        "snippet": "Wool bed blankets from Faribault Mill. Solid, stripe, and plaid designs made with high quality wool. Since 1865, Faribault Mill has been crafting premium wool blankets in the USA with an unwavering commitment to quality, durability, and heritage. For more than 150 years, our mill has perfected the art of wool blanket making—ensuring every piece we produce is made to last and designed to bring lasting comfort. Wool bed blankets from Faribault Mill. Solid, stripe, and plaid designs made with high quality wool. Wool is the world’s most sustainable fiber, and we honor its natural performance by maintaining a production process that prioritizes responsibility, longevity, and low environmental impact. The result: blankets that offer natural insulation, moisture-wicking comfort, and hypoallergenic benefits—ideal for year-round use and restful sleep. For over 160 years, we’ve crafted blankets and throws in the USA with timeless design, natural fibers, and unmatched craftsmanship.OUR STORY ... Natural fibers like wool and cotton help regulate body temperature for a deeper, more restful sleep — naturally.",
